', CHAR(13), '
The Export — the brown cigarillo with its distinctive coffee aroma — is probably the best-selling Swiss cigar in history. Its tubular form, recognizable red band, and accessible price made it the introduction to premium tobacco for millions of European smokers since 1946. It is not Villiger''s most ambitious product — it is the one that funded everything else and built the brand over two generations.') AS BINARY), CAST(`history_en` AS BINARY)) = 0) FROM `brands` WHERE `name` = 'Villiger'
